  "notes": "Sports-commentator narration (am_michael, fast, stadium). Brick (big, no patience) vs Noodle (unhittable, insufferable), Pebble the kid wins by dropping a ball. Escalation (v4, after review): slow pitch → Matrix dodge → faster → two at once → Gatling barrage vs frying pan → gives up → the kid. Ending: Brick throws his last ball at the camera. v1: no bullet-time yet. Alt hooks: 'Nobody hits Noodle.' / 'One ball. One kid.' v5: MJ moves (mj_toe/mj_lean/moonwalk) with a fedora that appears and vanishes, jump dodge, Brick goes red with ear steam, camera `focus` on the actor of each beat, coronation props attached to Pebble. v7: anger ramps (worried → fierce → angry → shocked → angry), lean held until the ball clears, no tag on KO bodies, focus on Pebble after arrival, higher jump.",
